\u0026#x000A;  \u003chr\u003e\u0026#x000A;\u003c/div\u003e\u0026#x000A;\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"25:1-25:100\" dir=\"auto\"\u003eWelcome to OpenHands 
(formerly OpenDevin), a platform for software development agents powered by AI.\u003c/p\u003e\u0026#x000A;\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"27:1-28:64\" 
dir=\"auto\"\u003eOpenHands agents can do anything a human developer can: modify code, run commands, browse the web,\u0026#x000A;call APIs, and yes—even 
copy code snippets from StackOverflow.\u003c/p\u003e\u0026#x000A;\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"30:1-30:108\" dir=\"auto\"\u003eLearn more at \u003ca 
data-sourcepos=\"30:15-30:62\" href=\"https://docs.all-hands.dev\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" 
target=\"_blank\"\u003edocs.all-hands.dev\u003c/a\u003e, or jump to the \u003ca data-sourcepos=\"30:80-30:107\" href=\"#-quick-start\"\u003eQuick 
