data-unicode-version=\"6.0\"\u003e📖\u003c/gl-emoji\u003e Documentation\u003c/h2\u003e\u0026#x000A;\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"76:1-77:92\" 
dir=\"auto\"\u003eTo learn more about the project, and for tips on using OpenHands,\u0026#x000A;\u003cstrong data-sourcepos=\"77:1-77:91\"\u003echeck out 
our \u003ca data-sourcepos=\"77:17-77:89\" href=\"https://docs.all-hands.dev/modules/usage/getting-started\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" 
target=\"_blank\"\u003edocumentation\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u0026#x000A;\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"79:1-80:62\" 
dir=\"auto\"\u003eThere you'll find resources on how to use different LLM providers,\u0026#x000A;troubleshooting resources, and advanced configuration 
options.\u003c/p\u003e\u0026#x000A;\u003ch2 data-sourcepos=\"82:1-82:25\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u0026#x000A;\u003ca href=\"#-how-to-contribute\" 
aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor\" id=\"user-content--how-to-contribute\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cgl-emoji title=\"handshake\" data-name=\"handshake\" 
data-unicode-version=\"9.0\"\u003e🤝\u003c/gl-emoji\u003e How to Contribute\u003c/h2\u003e\u0026#x000A;\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"84:1-86:66\" 
dir=\"auto\"\u003eOpenHands is a community-driven project, and we welcome contributions from everyone.\u0026#x000A;Whether you're a developer, a 
researcher, or simply enthusiastic about advancing the field of\u0026#x000A;software engineering with AI, there are many ways to get 
involved:\u003c/p\u003e\u0026#x000A;\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"88:1-91:0\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u0026#x000A;\u003cli 
data-sourcepos=\"88:1-88:133\"\u003e\u0026#x000A;\u003cstrong data-sourcepos=\"88:3-88:25\"\u003eCode Contributions:\u003c/strong\u003e Help us develop new
agents, core functionality, the frontend and other interfaces, or sandboxing solutions.\u003c/li\u003e\u0026#x000A;\u003cli 
data-sourcepos=\"89:1-89:158\"\u003e\u0026#x000A;\u003cstrong data-sourcepos=\"89:3-89:30\"\u003eResearch and Evaluation:\u003c/strong\u003e Contribute to 
our understanding of LLMs in software engineering, participate in evaluating the models, or suggest improvements.\u003c/li\u003e\u0026#x000A;\u003cli 
data-sourcepos=\"90:1-91:0\"\u003e\u0026#x000A;\u003cstrong data-sourcepos=\"90:3-90:27\"\u003eFeedback and Testing:\u003c/strong\u003e Use the OpenHands 
toolset, report bugs, suggest features, or provide feedback on usability.\u003c/li\u003e\u0026#x000A;\u003c/ul\u003e\u0026#x000A;\u003cp 
data-sourcepos=\"92:1-92:63\" dir=\"auto\"\u003eFor details, please check \u003ca data-sourcepos=\"92:27-92:62\" 
href=\"/root/openhands/-/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md\" class=\"gfm\"\u003eCONTRIBUTING.md\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u0026#x000A;\u003ch2 
data-sourcepos=\"94:1-94:26\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u0026#x000A;\u003ca href=\"#-join-our-community\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor\" 
id=\"user-content--join-our-community\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cgl-emoji title=\"robot face\" data-name=\"robot\" 
data-unicode-version=\"8.0\"\u003e🤖\u003c/gl-emoji\u003e Join Our Community\u003c/h2\u003e\u0026#x000A;\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"96:1-97:48\" 
dir=\"auto\"\u003eWhether you're a developer, a researcher, or simply enthusiastic about OpenHands, we'd love to have you in our 
